results.quote:
A total of 27 animals were enrolled; 15 died before the requisite 14 day period and were excluded from analysis (Table 1, Supplemental Digital Content,
https://links.lww.com/ASAIO/B755
). The remaining 12 animals completed the study and were included in the analysis: 6 in the heparin study and 6 in the heparin-free study.
